          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limits are unchanged — they already assume your usual treatment. What changes is the day's balance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حدودك لم تتغير — فهي تفترض بالفعل علاجك المعتاد. ما يتغير هو رصيد اليوم."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Grenzwerte sind unverändert – sie berücksichtigen bereits Ihre übliche Behandlung. Was sich ändert, ist die Bilanz des Tages."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus límites no cambian — ya asumen tu tratamiento habitual. Lo que cambia es el balance del día."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos limites restent inchangées — elles tiennent déjà compte de votre traitement habituel. Ce qui change, c'est l'équilibre du jour."
          }
        },
        "ha" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Iyakokin ka ba su canja — sun riga sun ɗauka jiyya na gida. Abin da ya canja shine ma'auni na jiya."
          }
        },
        "ig" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oke gị adịghị agbanwe — ha ejiri ihe a na-eme gị na-ewere ya. Ihe na-agbanwe bụ nke ụbọchị a"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seus limites não mudaram — eles já consideram seu tratamento habitual. O que muda é o balanço do dia."
          }
        },
        "sw" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mipaka yako haibadiliki — tayari inachukulia matibabu yako ya kawaida. Kinachobadilika ni usawa wa siku."
          }
        },
        "yo" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Àwọn ìlànà rẹ kò yípadà — wọ́n ti ṣe àkíyèsí ìtọ́jú àgbàlagbà rẹ. Ohun tí ó yípadà ni ìwọ̀n ọjọ́ náà."
          }
        },
        "zh" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的限制值未变——它们已经考虑了您的常规治疗。改变的是当天的平衡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own health record, meals and tracking live in the patient view." : {
